      "description": "Ordering ahead is just a download away. Get the Starbucks® app for an easier way to enjoy your favorites and discover Rewards in every sip as a member. \n\nORDER SEAMLESSLY \n• Order in the app when you’re on your way\n• Customize and create your perfect drink\n• Save your favorite stores\n• View past orders & save custom drinks \n• Save payment methods and scan to pay in stores\n• Tip your barista for your delicious drink\n\nJOIN STARBUCKS® REWARDS\n• Earn Stars to use on free food & drinks\n• Start at Green status & level up to Gold or Reserve for exclusive benefits\n• Enjoy a free drink on your birthday*, plus more time to redeem as you level up\n• Try one free customization a month on Free Mod Mondays**\n• Enjoy early access to new items\n• Get Bonus Stars for digitally reloading your Starbucks Card (minimum $30)\n• Explore games and offers just for you\n\nSEND & SAVE eGIFTS \n• Save all your Starbucks Cards in one spot\n• Send eGifts via email, text, or messaging app\n• Choose from unique designs for every occasion\n\nFIND A STORE\n• See stores near you\n• Get directions and hours\n• View store amenities like drive-thru & Wi-Fi \n\nMust be a Starbucks Rewards member to enjoy exclusive member benefits and app features.\n\n*Birthday Reward: \nGreen members: Redeemable on member’s birthday only, at participating stores.   \nGold members: Redeemable for 7 days starting on member’s birthday, at participating stores. \nReserve members: Redeemable for 30 days starting on member’s birthday, at participating stores.   \nFree birthday drink must be standard menu size. \nExcludes alcohol and multi-serve items.  To qualify, you must have made at least one Star-earning transaction prior to your birthday each year. \n \n**Mod Monday: \nRedeemable at participating stores.  Members will receive one free customization each month, up to $2 (pre-tax) each. Not valid for use with Rewards or other offers, discounts or promotions.",
